{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":44678,"duration_api_ms":46805,"ttft_ms":22102,"ttft_stream_ms":1135,"time_to_request_ms":68,"num_turns":3,"result":"{\"verdict\":\"ACCEPT\",\"blockers\":[],\"required_changes\":[],\"tests\":[{\"test_name\":\"compare_cycle_counts_only_on_diff_write\",\"input\":\"run recorder写完run_id=R1结果；lifecycle消费同一RunResultEnvelope；写入{run_id:R1, ledger_high_watermark:H1}的lifecycle_projection_diff\",\"expected\":\"计1个compare cycle；未写diff前(仅run result存在)不计cycle\"},{\"test_name\":\"compare_cycle_retry_not_double_counted\",\"input\":\"对同一run_id=R1的RunResultEnvelope重复投递并触发第二次diff写入尝试\",\"expected\":\"cycle计数不因同一run_id的重试而新增，仍计为1个cycle\"},{\"test_name\":\"cutover_gate_resets_on_single_diff\",\"input\":\"连续29个zero-diff cycle后第30个cycle在closure reason字段出现1处差异\",\"expected\":\"连续计数归零，compare→authoritative门槛不满足\"},{\"test_name\":\"lifecycle_process_has_no_os_write_permission\",\"input\":\"lifecycle服务进程尝试以其OS账户对pending slot目录执行写操作(如创建/修改文件)\",\"expected\":\"因只读ACL被操作系统拒绝，写操作失败，不依赖Python层检查\"},{\"test_name\":\"ci_static_check_blocks_forbidden_imports\",\"input\":\"lifecycle服务代码新增对PendingResearchInputStore.claim的import\",\"expected\":\"CI静态检查失败，阻止合入\"},{\"test_name\":\"reconciler_prefers_reconstruct_result_over_stale_yaml\",\"input\":\"pending_research_input.yaml显示某operation为claimed，但_reconstruct()在store锁内返回该operation的history最后有效状态为consumed\",\"expected\":\"reconciler以_reconstruct()返回结果为准，按consumed状态处理，不使用stale yaml状态\"},{\"test_name\":\"reconciler_only_admits_matched_operation_states\",\"input\":\"某admission_operation_id在pending/history中找不到匹配的pending|claimed|consumed状态及admission key/nonce\",\"expected\":\"该attempt永远不补写question_admission，保持未准入\"},{\"test_name\":\"closure_append_rejects_second_reason\",\"input\":\"question Q1已有closure(policy_budget, not_validated)；随后reconciliation产生更高优先级候选evidence_backed\",\"expected\":\"append_closure返回原有policy_budget事件，不生成/不覆盖为evidence_backed\"},{\"test_name\":\"closure